guidelines should be adhered to.  4.2.1 Guideline 1  To impart strength and fatigue resistance, the
fraction of the y' phase should be optimised by appropriate choice of the y'-forming elements (Al,
Ti and Ta) – placing it in the range 40% to 55% – and heat treatments chosen to promote a uniform
