2026-01-16 18:27:49,912 [INFO] root - [9] 来源: Distribution of rhenium in a single crystal nickel-based superalloy (块: None)
Scanning transmission electron microscopy and energy dispersive X-ray spectroscopy have been
utilized to investigate the distribution of Re in a single crystal nickel-based superalloy. Two
types of distributions of element Re have been found near interfaces after creep tests, one in the γ
phases, the other near dislocation cores. Re enrichment near dislocation cores is considered to
strengthen the high-temperature performance of superalloys by hindering dislocation movement.

2026-01-16 18:27:49,912 [INFO] root - [10] 来源: The influence of the dendritic structure on the γ/γ′-lattice misfit in the single-crystal nickel-base superalloy CMSX-4 (块: None)
The γ/γ′-lattice misfit was measured locally by X-ray diffraction in the rhenium-containing single-
crystal nickel-base superalloy CMSX-4. Different sections of a single crystal casting and positions
in the dendritic structure have been analyzed. A remarkable difference of the misfit caused by
segregation of refractory elements was found between the dendrite center and periphery. Problems of
measurement and characterization of the γ/γ′-lattice misfit in superalloys of new generations with a
high refractory element level are discussed.

