2026-01-16 18:31:21,707 [INFO] root - [1] 来源: Elastic moduli and load partitioning in a single-crystal nickel superalloy (块: None)
The constrained moduli of the γ and γ′ phases of the Ni superalloy CMSX-4 have been determined using
in situ neutron diffraction. The elastic moduli of the isolated phases fitted using a model are
found to be E[100]=103GPa in the γ and 134GPa in the γ′ at room temperature, while at 900°C they are
96 and 90GPa. Therefore load partitions markedly to the γ′ phase at room temperature but there is
little load partitioning at elevated temperatures.

