their effect of CMAS infiltration in the TBC topcoat are discussed in detail. A detailed analysis
based on the weight gain by thermogravimetric charts, thermally grown oxide thickness and
penetration of CMAS by field emission scanning electron microscope is made. The corrosion products
formed and the phases presented were analysed using the X-ray diffraction technique.

