nitrided layer significantly increased with the increase of nitriding temperature, and the diffusion
activation energy of IN-901 was calculated as ~153 kJ/mol (1.6 eV). Micro-hardness and sliding tests
proved a high surface hardness (up to ~1892 HV0.025) and a low friction coefficient (~0.22) of the
nitrided IN-901.

