respectively. It was concluded that the diffusion of both C and Nb atoms in the Ni matrix are the
underlying mechanisms for the NbC carbide formation during homogenization heat treatment. The
relationship of 1/t0.5exp(0.0097T) was also obtained for the precipitation rate as a function of
temperature.

