To prepare Re-Hf co-doped β-NiAl coating, a simple and universal method of composite electroplating
NiRe + Hf particles and subsequent arc ion plating (AIP) was adopted. The result indicated that Re-
Hf co-doped β-NiAl coating were composed of outer β-NiAl layer with dispersed (Re,Hf)-rich
