temperature to 1000 °C. During this procedure, there is an escalation in the trend towards
deformation homogenization, leading to a transition in fracture mode from shear fracture to normal
fracture. A novel approach is introduced in the form of an entropy-based fatigue life prediction
model, grounded in the correlation between cumulative plastic strain and entropy increase rate.
