2026-01-26 19:30:52,386 [INFO] root - Reduce阶段：筛选出 3 个高质量关键点，内容如下：[{'answer': 'Desirable properties in single crystal superalloy design include high-temperature performance (maximized via the Larson-Miller parameter at 100 MPa), phase stability governed by metallurgical parameters such as Md(γ) and Md(total), balanced refractory element ratios like Mo/(Mo + W), low density, corrosion resistance, and adherence to specified composition ranges. Trade-offs exist between maximizing high-temperature creep resistance (via Larson-Miller parameter) and minimizing density—lower density often reduces weight but may compromise mechanical strength or phase stability. Similarly, enforcing strict metallurgical constraints (e.g., Md values) ensures microstructural integrity but may limit compositional flexibility needed for corrosion resistance or manufacturability [cite: chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-1, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-8, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-6, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-7, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-5, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-4, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-3, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-e-10, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-2, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-3, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-4, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-5, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-6, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-7, chunk-dd50adc6b05a6ca29b181a3964b80104-r-9]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': 'When designing a new single-crystal Ni-based superalloy composition, desirable properties include the presence of secondary γ′ precipitates for enhanced mechanical strength and high-temperature performance, precise microstructural control (e.g., orientation of un-melted short seeds and use of bilateral four-notched micro specimens), and compatibility with advanced machining techniques like Ultrasonic Vibration Cutting (UVC) to improve manufacturability. However, trade-offs exist: while secondary γ′ precipitates strengthen the alloy, features such as inclined and diffusive holes—introduced during processing—can cause localized stress concentration, potentially compromising structural integrity despite improved machinability [cite: chunk-43d5f0bb5122e9d5be4fa1747b37fa27-e-2, chunk-c54d53facfcd0c04940e81f722c64675-e-1, chunk-48b41bf725b3f9bb5aa816fb0e0f95fa-e-5, chunk-29f36b63ffbfa93a0849716946319e66-e-2, chunk-f9e35d391cf80d108927ff541d6abfea-e-1, chunk-80c8238b218e9114396c9c914520402a-e-4, chunk-0a064d5af4b168f8830ac6b6a4a91f76-e-6, chunk-474b879f46a2c1ba157130a50c118107-e-3, chunk-e9a7227e846ea9580d5ba72c9a0f08c1-e-2, chunk-e9a7227e846ea9580d5ba72c9a0f08c1-e-6, chunk-dd2210f9340229066d3e29977613cfd1-e-2, chunk-766beb00392baa2f35945ebcd36ce418-e-2, chunk-c54d53facfcd0c04940e81f722c64675-r-1, chunk-48b41bf725b3f9bb5aa816fb0e0f95fa-r-27, chunk-29f36b63ffbfa93a0849716946319e66-r-4, chunk-f9e35d391cf80d108927ff541d6abfea-r-2, chunk-80c8238b218e9114396c9c914520402a-r-17, chunk-0a064d5af4b168f8830ac6b6a4a91f76-r-6, chunk-474b879f46a2c1ba157130a50c118107-r-2, chunk-474b879f46a2c1ba157130a50c118107-r-17, chunk-e9a7227e846ea9580d5ba72c9a0f08c1-r-5, chunk-dd2210f9340229066d3e29977613cfd1-r-1, chunk-766beb00392baa2f35945ebcd36ce418-r-1]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': 'When designing a new single crystal Ni-based superalloy composition, desirable properties include high-temperature strength, creep resistance, and thermal stability—largely enabled by the γ′ phase (Ni₃(Al,Ti)), which acts as a coherent precipitate within the γ matrix to impede dislocation motion. Single-crystal configurations further enhance these properties by eliminating grain boundaries. However, trade-offs exist: increasing γ′ volume fraction improves strength but may reduce ductility or fabricability; optimizing for extreme temperature performance can compromise oxidation resistance or phase stability over long durations [cite: chunk-e711ea9893c91fd5ce884c423d1ba069-e-1, chunk-e711ea9893c91fd5ce884c423d1ba069-e-2, chunk-e711ea9893c91fd5ce884c423d1ba069-r-1].', 'score': 8}]
