2026-01-26 22:46:03,907 [INFO] root - [3] 来源: Thermal barrier coatings for high-temperature application on superalloy substrates - A review (块: None)
On account of protecting the metal components which are subjected to high temperatures like power
plant's turbine blades and internal combustion engines, the thermal barrier coating is
indispensable. The coating provides effective thermal insulation to the components and permits
higher operating temperature, increasing the component's life by reducing oxidation, thermal
fatigue, and increasing the durability of the substrate. Different coating techniques like Plasma
spray, Electron-beam physical vapor deposition, bond coat, topcoat materials, and superalloy
substrate materials were investigated.This paper reviewed researches on thermal barrier coating
techniques, recent findings of coating materials, property difference at high-temperature
performance, and failure mechanism and the findings of this review can be adopted for future
researches.

