tempeature-low activity and low temperature-high activity was performed. The results of structural
investigations by scanning electron microscope and X-Ray diffraction indicated a three-zone
structure of coating in all thicknesses of platinum layer, as well as in the two methods of
aluminizing. Surface roughness of coatings was measured in three steps: 1-after Pt plating, 2-after
