oxide component plays a certain role on thermophysical properties. In this paper, a type of silicate
enamel coating with different contents of oxide component Al2O3 was prepared on K444 superalloy. Its
microstructural evolution and cyclic oxidation behavior at 1000 °C were investigated. Results
