The aluminide coatings with and without Si modification were prepared on the new γ′-strengthened
cobalt-based superalloy using a pack cementation method. Cyclic oxidation of the coated Co-based
superalloy was study at 1050 °C. The weight changes of Al coating and Al-Si coating were -4.28
