In the present investigation plasma spray metallic coating of nickel-aluminide was deposited on a
Fe-based Superalloy (32Ni-21Cr-1.5Mn-1Si-0.3Ti-0.3Al-0.1C and Balance Fe) by shrouded plasma spray
process. NiCrAlY was used as a bond coat. Erosion studies were conducted, using an air-jet erosion
