2026-01-26 23:50:57,201 [INFO] root - Reduce阶段：筛选出 3 个高质量关键点，内容如下：[{'answer': 'Yes, the rate of thermally grown oxide (TGO) formation on an aluminised single crystal superalloy during isothermal oxidation is likely altered by the addition of a ceramic YSZ (yttria-stabilized zirconia) layer because aluminum oxide (the TGO) forms beneath the zirconia coating as part of the thermal barrier system. The presence of the YSZ layer influences oxygen diffusion and interfacial reactions, thereby affecting TGO growth kinetics. [cite: chunk-fc9c3795a813f2475179e5807a394e7f-e-1, chunk-fc9c3795a813f2475179e5807a394e7f-e-2, chunk-fc9c3795a813f2475179e5807a394e7f-r-1]', 'score': 8}, {'answer': 'Yes, the addition of a ceramic YSZ layer is likely to alter the rate of thermally grown oxide (TGO) formation on an aluminised single crystal superalloy during isothermal oxidation. This is because specific weight gain—used as a proxy for oxidation/TGO formation—is influenced by both aluminum concentration and yttrium content in the system. Aluminum concentration positively correlates with specific weight gain [Data: Entities (chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-4, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-2); Relationships (chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-r-1)], while yttrium concentration also correlates with specific weight gain [Data: Entities (chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-4, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-3); Relationships (chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-r-3)]. Since YSZ contains yttria (Y₂O₃), its presence introduces yttrium into the system, which may modify oxidation kinetics. Moreover, the YSZ layer acts as a physical barrier that can slow oxygen diffusion to the bond coat, thereby potentially reducing TGO growth rate. The interplay between composition (Al, Y) and oxidation behavior suggests the ceramic topcoat indirectly influences TGO formation dynamics. [cite: chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-2, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-3, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-e-4, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-r-1, chunk-60aaf9203ef3ac8be9f25ac9c0695fd4-r-3]', 'score': 8}, {'answer': 'The provided context does not directly address whether the addition of a ceramic YSZ layer alters the rate of TGO formation on an aluminised single-crystal superalloy during isothermal oxidation. Instead, it describes TGO formation as occurring during isothermal oxidation and on the superalloy substrate, and notes that TGO (and a separate oxidation process) may subsequently affect the YSZ layer—not the reverse. There is no evidence in the data suggesting that YSZ influences the kinetics or rate of TGO growth. [cite: chunk-a40956025386a6a3ce8ffbe5ab8d14d9-e-2, chunk-a40956025386a6a3ce8ffbe5ab8d14d9-e-3, chunk-a40956025386a6a3ce8ffbe5ab8d14d9-e-4, chunk-a40956025386a6a3ce8ffbe5ab8d14d9-r-1, chunk-a40956025386a6a3ce8ffbe5ab8d14d9-r-2]', 'score': 5}]
